combine
 - 900g lean ground pork or turkey
 - 90g soy sauce
 - 50g hoisin
 - 50g grated ginger
 - 15g rice vinegar
 - 15g sweet chili sauce
 - 2 tsp garlic powder

thinly slice white and green seperately from
 - 2-4 green onions

cook in a wide base pot for the lowest amount of time suggested, 5-6 minutes
 - 250g medium width rice noodles
drain and rinse
heat pot on high
add oil
add meat
cook covered 
stir often until just done
there should be a lot of liquid
set meat aside
add
 - 100g grated carrot
 - white part of green onions
bring to boil
add
 - 450g thinly sliced Nappa cabbage
cook 2 minutes
add noodles
cook 1 minute
add meat
cook until heated through
stir in 
 - 10g sesame oil
 - 2 tbsp sesame seeds
rest 3 minutes until noodles have absorbed most liquid
serve with
 - black vinegar
 - sesame seeds
 - green part of green onions
